  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among lone immortals he has a huge network and is willing to deduce for payment. He has some achievements in cultivation, though he cannot match Eastern Sea’s top three wisdom path experts, named in the saying as Jia Dan sitting in twin polar, Hua An hiding in Nan Gong, and Dragon Head Tortoise living inside adversity sea. Miao Ming Shen asks to talk after the trades and have him deduce something. Gong Liang Bai asks if it is Liu Guan Yi, saying he has received many requests about that person. Told it is not, he says he has already made five deductions and failed each time, with too few clues, and that Liu Guan Yi has methods to defend against deductions.",
